417	     * A user whose role may reassign (a steward, unless the permission matrix says otherwise) moves a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet. It keeps its number
418	     * and date, loses any figure a statement bound it to (live again until its new person's next
419	     * statement), and is listed as its new person's newest claim. A SETTLED or VOID claim cannot move,
420	     * nor one due inside a closed period, nor one dated after its new person's retirement date.
421	     */
